# Dantooine, Vrook found (TSL, 601DAN, 602DAN, 604DAN): Suulru given his
# modulator and the 500 Jorran took (LSP), Zherron the two salvagers'
# bodies and their will unchanged (LSP), the crystal cave's mercenary camp:
# here to rescue the Jedi (LSP), the captain and his men fought, Vrook out
# of his cage (apologised to, Khoonda's coming attack); Azkul outside the
# cave refused (his plans not to succeed: LSP) and his men fought, and the
# Administrator's master card key for Khoonda's defence. Starts from the
# salvagers' camp:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_camp data/routes/tsl/dantooine_vrook.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Return to the Crystal Cave" and "The Mercenary
# Attack" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit To_601@2        # back by the courtyard's east way
module 601dan
exit To_602
module 602dan
say Here is your modulator and the 500 credits # Suulru (LSP)
use npc_suulru
talk
to npc_berun         # BLOCKER: by Berun's desk (dantooine_khoonda)
say I have the bodies right here. # Zherron: the will unchanged (LSP)
use npc_zherron
talk
to npc_berun         # BLOCKER: back by Berun's desk (dantooine_khoonda)
exit To_601
module 601dan
exit To_604
module 604dan
say I'm here to rescue the Jedi. # the mercenaries holding Vrook (LSP)
say I don't want to fight, but I can't let you take Vrook
to tr_merc_cave
talk
fight 60
talk                 # Vrook out of his cage
use MilLowMetalBox@1 # the camp's boxes
use MilLowMetalBox@2
say I've learned that you are planning an assault # Azkul: refused (LSP)
say I would never help you.
say I'm not interested.
say I cannot allow your plans to succeed.
exit To_601
module 601dan
talk
fight 60             # his men
exit To_602
module 602dan
use npc_terena       # the master card key: Khoonda's defence
talk
save dantooine_attack
